#hCurators is now available in Spanish & Hindi

@yusmelys @ineyashami @bhattg @suisver @dominic1 @angeluxx @robotgirl2024 @davidpena21 @cositav @katriel1 @arribaeltelon @sacra97 @erickalife @arribaeltelon @ismeris @cayitus63 @teslamaria<br/>
